[00:20.14]Jehovah God, I call to you and ask you:
[00:25.54]“Hear my prayer.”
[00:28.08]My wounds are deep and slow to heal;
[00:32.16]my load is hard to bear.
[00:36.44]Despondent thoughts and disappointed hopes
[00:41.42]have left me weak.
[00:44.70]O God of comfort, care for me;
[00:48.88]your favor I do seek.
[00:54.23](Chorus)
[00:54.38]Do raise me up; help me endure.
[01:03.22]When I’m in doubt, make my hope sure.
[01:11.78]From deep despair, I turn to you.
[01:20.53]Jehovah God, my strength renew.
[01:39.76]Your Word has been my comfort and
[01:43.64]a refuge when I’m weak,
[01:47.88]Expressing feelings dear to me
[01:51.57]in words I cannot speak.
[01:56.12]Please build in me the faith and trust
[02:00.37]that your Word does impart.
[02:04.58]And help me always know your love
[02:08.74]is greater than my heart.
[02:13.57](Chorus)
[02:13.72]Do raise me up; help me endure.
[02:22.88]When I’m in doubt, make my hope sure.
[02:31.42]From deep despair, I turn to you.
[02:39.88]Jehovah God, my strength renew.
